@startuml
title Fase 6 - Publico replicado y mano privada
package Host {
  [ServerSession] as S
  [GameManager\nGameState privado] as G
  [StateProjection] as P
  [NetworkManager] as H
  [StateSpawner\nauthority=1] as SP
  [PublicState\nsolo PublicJson] as PUB
  [StateSynchronizer\nOnChange, visibility=false] as SY
}
package Cliente {
  [PublicState remoto] as RP
  [NetworkManager cliente] as C
  [ClientStateAssembler] as A
  [SnapshotDto coherente] as V
}
S --> G : comandos validados
S --> P : vista autorizada
P --> H : privado del destinatario
P --> PUB : PublicSnapshotDto
H --> SP : spawn publico
SP --> PUB : crea una replica
PUB --> SY
SY --> RP : autoridad 1\nsolo peers admitidos
H --> C : RpcId: PrivateSnapshotDto
RP --> A : parte publica
C --> A : parte privada
A --> V : misma sesion y revision
note bottom of G
No replicar mazo ordenado, semilla,
manos ajenas ni reclamos pendientes.
end note
@enduml

@startuml
title Coherencia entre dos transportes
participant Servidor as S
participant "Synchronizer / replica" as R
participant "RPC privado" as P
participant ClientStateAssembler as A
participant Presentacion as UI
S -> R : publico revision 21
S -> P : mano revision 21
P -> A : privado 21
note right of A : conserva vista 20
R -> A : publico 21
A -> UI : vista completa 21
S -> P : ActionReply revision 21
P -> UI : entregar solo con View.Revision >= 21
@enduml
